                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i><span>የበር፣ ኮርኒስ እና ግድግዳ አቧራ ማፅዳት</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <button onclick="quickBookSvc('residential', 2500, 'ቤት')" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>የቤት ፅዳት ይዘዙ (Book Home)</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 6: Commercial -->
            <div class="glass-card-interactive rounded-3xl p-7 relative flex flex-col justify-between" onmousemove="handleTilt(event, this)" onmouseleave="resetTilt(this)">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-5 border border-purple-500/30 shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/10">
                        🏢
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white">የድርጅት እና ቢሮ ፅዳት</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-400 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-800">በኮንትራት / ካሬ</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-5">ለባንኮች፣ ኤምባሲዎች፣ ሆቴሎች እና ኮርፖሬት ቢሮዎች የሚሰጥ ቋሚ ወይም የአንድ ጊዜ የኮንትራት ፅዳት።</p>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2 mb-6">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i><span>ኦፊሴላዊ የግብር ደረሰኝ እና ቫት (VAT)</span></li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i><span>በደንብ የሰለጠኑ ዩኒፎርም የለበሱ ሰራተኞች</span></li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400"></i><span>ከስራ ሰዓት ውጭ (ምሽት/ቅዳሜና እሁድ) ስራ</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <button onclick="quickBookSvc('commercial', 5000, 'ተቋም')" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>የድርጅት ፕሮፎርማ ጠይቅ</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- INTERACTIVE 3D LIVE COST ESTIMATOR -->
    <section id="calculator" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-slate-950 border-y border-white/5 relative z-20">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-10">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Live Price Estimator</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-2">የዋጋ ማሽን (Interactive Cost Calculator)</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">አገልግሎት እና መጠኑን ይምረጡ፤ ወዲያውኑ የሚከፍሉትን ትክክለኛ የብር መጠን ይመልከቱ።</p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-2xl">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">1. አገልግሎት ይምረጡ</label>
                            <select id="calc-service" onchange="calculatePrice()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500">
                                <option value="sofa" data-price="350" data-unit="መቀመጫ (Seats)">🛋 የሶፋ ጥልቅ እጥበት (350 ብር / መቀመጫ)</option>
                                <option value="carpet" data-price="80" data-unit="ካሬ ሜትር (Sqm)">🧶 የምንጣፍ ማጠብና ስቲም (80 ብር / ካሬ)</option>
                                <option value="mattress" data-price="600" data-unit="ፍራሽ (Mattress)">🛏 የፍራሽ ሳኒታይዜሽን (600 ብር / ፍራሽ)</option>
                                <option value="glass" data-price="70" data-unit="ካሬ ሜትር (Sqm)">🪟 የመስታወት ፅዳት (70 ብር / ካሬ)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                                <label class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider" id="calc-unit-label">2. የመቀመጫዎች ብዛት (Quantity)</label>
                                <span class="text-lg font-black text-cyan-400" id="calc-qty-badge">5</span>
                            </div>
                            <input type="range" id="calc-range" min="1" max="50" value="5" oninput="updateRangeValue(this.value)" class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-cyan-500">
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">
                                <span>1</span>
                                <span>10</span>
                                <span>25</span>
                                <span>50+</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Output Card -->
                    <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-950/80 via-blue-950/70 to-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 text-center shadow-xl">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">የተገመተ ጠቅላላ ዋጋ (Estimated Total)</span>
                        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-cyan-300 my-3" id="calc-total-display">1,750 ብር</div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6" id="calc-summary-desc">5 መቀመጫ ሶፋ በ 350 ብር = 1,750 ብር</p>

                        <button onclick="bookCalculatedPrice()" class="w-full py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm shadow-3d-cyan flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all">
                            <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                            <span>በዚህ ዋጋ ቀጠሮ ይያዙ (Book at this price)</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REAL CARRIER SMS TEST WIDGET SECTION -->
    <section id="sms-test-section" class="py-16 relative z-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-md">
                        📱
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white">የቀጥታ የኤስኤምኤስ (Real SMS) መሞከሪያ</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">ስልክ ቁጥርዎን በማስገባት የሜሽ የኤስኤምኤስ ማረጋገጫ መልዕክት ይሞክሩ</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800 text-xs font-bold">AfroMessage / Ethio Telecom SMS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase mb-1">የሞባይል ስልክ ቁጥርዎ *</label>
                        <input type="tel" id="test-sms-phone" value="0943854325" placeholder="0943854325" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase mb-1">የመልዕክት ይዘት (አማራጭ)</label>
                        <textarea id="test-sms-message" rows="2" placeholder="የሙከራ የኤስኤምኤስ ከሜሽ የፅዳት አገልግሎት..." class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500"></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" onclick="dispatchTestSms()" id="btn-dispatch-test-sms" class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all">
                        <i data-lucide="send" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>📨 የሙከራ ኤስኤምኤስ ወደ ስልኬ ላክ (Send Test SMS)</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between text-xs">
                    <div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-300 block mb-2">📋 የሲስተም ሁኔታ (Gateway Status):</span>
                        <div id="sms-test-result" class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                            ስልክ ቁጥርዎን አስገብተው አረንጓዴውን ቁልፍ ሲጫኑ የኤስኤምኤስ ምላሽ እዚህ ጋር ይታያል።
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 text-[10px] text-slate-500">
                        💡 በኢትዮጵያ ውስጥ ወደ ደንበኞች እውነተኛ ሲም ካርድ SMS ለመላክ የ AfroMessage Token በ <code>.env</code> ውስጥ ማከል ይቻላል።
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LIVE ORDER TRACKER SECTION -->
    <section id="track" class="py-16 relative z-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                    <i data-lucide="navigation" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">የትዕዛዝ ሁኔታ መከታተያ (Track Order)</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">የትዕዛዝ ቁጥርዎን (ለምሳሌ MEASH-000024) ወይም ስልክ ቁጥርዎን በማስገባት የፅዳት ቡድኑን ሁኔታ ይከታተሉ</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <form id="form-track" onsubmit="trackOrder(event)" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
                <input type="text" id="track-input" required placeholder="የትዕዛዝ ቁጥር ወይም ስልክ ቁጥር ያስገቡ..." class="flex-1 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-500">
                <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span>ይፈትሹ</span>
                </button>
            </form>
            <div id="track-result" class="hidden mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-700/80"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 7-STEP CUSTOMER BOOKING WIZARD (Direct Database Connection) -->
    <section id="book" class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-slate-950 border-t border-white/5 relative z-20">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <span class="inline-block px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Fast 1-Minute Reservation</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white mt-3">የፅዳት ቀጠሮ ማስያዣ</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">በቀጥታ ከሪሴፕሽን ዳሽቦርዳችን ጋር የተገናኘ፤ ቀጠሮዎ በኤስኤምኤስ እና በስልክ ወዲያውኑ ይረጋገጣል።</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Wizard Card -->
            <div class="glass-panel border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl">
                <!-- Progress Indicators -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-slate-700/80">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 text-white text-xs font-black flex items-center justify-center" id="wizard-step-badge">1</span>
                        <span class="font-extrabold text-sm text-white" id="wizard-step-title">አገልግሎት ይምረጡ</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">ደረጃ <span id="current-step-num">1</span> ከ 4</span>
                </div>

                <form id="booking-form" onsubmit="submitBooking(event)">
                    <!-- STEP 1: Services & Items -->
                    <div id="step-1" class="wizard-step">
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mb-4">1. ዋናውን አገልግሎት ይምረጡ</h4>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-6" id="wizard-service-selector">
                            <button type="button" onclick="selectServiceForBooking('sofa')" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-500 bg-cyan-950/40 text-left transition-all svc-select-btn" data-svc="sofa">
                                <span class="text-2xl block mb-1">🛋</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">የሶፋ እጥበት</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400">350 ብር / መቀመጫ</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="selectServiceForBooking('carpet')" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 text-left transition-all svc-select-btn" data-svc="carpet">
                                <span class="text-2xl block mb-1">🧶</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">የምንጣፍ ማጠብ</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400">80 ብር / ካሬ</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="selectServiceForBooking('mattress')" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 text-left transition-all svc-select-btn" data-svc="mattress">
                                <span class="text-2xl block mb-1">🛏</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">የፍራሽ ሳኒታይዜሽን</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400">600 ብር / ፍራሽ</span>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="selectServiceForBooking('glass')" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 text-left transition-all svc-select-btn" data-svc="glass">
                                <span class="text-2xl block mb-1">🪟</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block">የመስታወት ፅዳት</span>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400">70 ብር / ካሬ</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mb-2">2. መጠን / ብዛት</h4>
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white block" id="wizard-selected-svc-title">የሶፋ ጥልቅ እጥበት</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400" id="wizard-unit-desc">የመቀመጫ ብዛት (Seats)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <button type="button" onclick="changeWizardQty(-1)" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 transition-all">-</button>
                                <span id="wizard-qty" class="text-lg font-black text-white w-10 text-center">5</span>
                                <button type="button" onclick="changeWizardQty(1)" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-slate-700 active:scale-95 transition-all">+</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">የተገመተ ጠቅላላ ዋጋ:</span>
                            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400" id="wizard-total-preview">1,750.00 ብር</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex justify-end">
                            <button type="button" onclick="nextWizardStep(2)" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg">
                                <span>ወደ አድራሻ ይቀጥሉ</span>
                                <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- STEP 2: Location / Address with Real GPS & Accuracy Feedback -->
                    <div id="step-2" class="wizard-step hidden">
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-200 mb-2">የፅዳት አድራሻ በአዲስ አበባ</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4">ፅዳት የሚደረግበት ቦታ ላይ ከሆኑ የቀጥታ ጂፒኤስ ካርታ መላክ ይችላሉ:: በቤትዎ ካልሆኑ አድራሻዎን ከታች ይጻፉ::</p>

                        <!-- Live GPS Detection Card -->
                        <div class="mb-5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-950/40 to-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30">
                            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white block flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                        <i data-lucide="navigation" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400"></i>
                                        <span>📍 የቀጥታ ካርታ / Live GPS መገኛ</span>
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">አሁን ባሉበት ቦታ ሆነው የቀጥታ ካርታ ፒን ያያይዙ</span>
                                </div>
                                <button type="button" onclick="detectWebGpsLocation()" id="btn-web-gps" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-4 py-2.5 bg-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/30 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0 transition-all">
                                    <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400"></i>
                                    <span id="btn-web-gps-txt">ካርታዬን ያዝ (Get GPS)</span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
